sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor H as Human
    participant UI as F1 page and<br/>shared panel
    participant BE as f1-backend
    participant MA as Multi-Agent<br/>Server
    participant P as Planner
    participant W as Worker
    participant R as Reviewer

    H->>UI: Readiness review
    UI->>BE: POST /release-reviews
    BE->>MA: POST /runs
    MA-->>UI: 202, run ID
    MA->>P: objective, inputs
    P-->>MA: 2 read-only steps
    MA->>W: plan
    Note over W: MCP: data.release_inspect.v1,<br/>data.releases.v1
    W-->>MA: findings, evidence
    MA->>R: plan, output, checks
    R-->>MA: recommendation
    Note over MA: awaiting_human<br/>history and audit appended
    UI->>BE: poll run and history
    BE->>MA: GET /runs/{id}
    MA-->>UI: plan, evidence, review
    H->>UI: correct, with a note
    UI->>BE: POST decision
    BE->>MA: POST decision
    MA->>W: re-run with the note
    W-->>MA: round 2 evidence
    MA->>R: review round 2
    R-->>MA: recommendation
    H->>UI: partial: accept release step
    UI->>BE: POST decision
    BE->>MA: POST decision
    MA-->>UI: partially_accepted
